THOUGHT: The error is about passing a possibly null Actor `a` into `c.maxWidth.get(a)` where `get` expects non-null. Other similar uses (padLeft, prefWidth, etc.) likely have the same annotation but NullAway only reported this one. The safest minimal fix is to guard all these `get(a)` calls with a null check and use a neutral default when `a` is null (e.g., zero padding/spacing and using the raw numeric values for min/pref/max sizes). I’ll update computeSize() to compute these values conditionally based on whether `a` is null, without changing behavior when `a` is non-null, then run the NullAway build to confirm the error count drops by one and no new errors appear.

```bash
cd /home/vscode/nullness-benchmarks/libgdx && sed -i '883,909{s/Actor a = c.actor;/Actor a = c.actor;

      float padLeft = c.padLeft.get(a);
      float padTop = c.padTop.get(a);
      float padRight = c.padRight.get(a);
      float padBottom = c.padBottom.get(a);
      float spaceLeft = c.spaceLeft.get(a);
      float spaceRightVal = c.spaceRight.get(a);
      float spaceTop = c.spaceTop.get(a);
      float spaceBottom = c.spaceBottom.get(a);
      float prefWidthVal = c.prefWidth.get(a);
      float prefHeightVal = c.prefHeight.get(a);
      float minWidthVal = c.minWidth.get(a);
      float minHeightVal = c.minHeight.get(a);
      float maxWidthVal = c.maxWidth.get(a);
      float maxHeightVal = c.maxHeight.get(a);

      if (a == null) {
        // When there is no actor, treat paddings and spacings as zero and use raw size values.
        padLeft = padTop = padRight = padBottom = 0f;
        spaceLeft = spaceRightVal = spaceTop = spaceBottom = 0f;
      }/;894,903{s/c.padLeft.get(a)/padLeft/;s/c.spaceLeft.get(a)/spaceLeft/;s/c.padTop.get(a)/padTop/;s/c.spaceTop.get(a)/spaceTop/;s/above.spaceBottom.get(a)/above.spaceBottom.get(a)/;s/c.spaceRight.get(a)/spaceRightVal/;s/c.padRight.get(a)/padRight/;s/c.padBottom.get(a)/padBottom/;s/c.spaceBottom.get(a)/spaceBottom/};901s/float spaceRight = c.spaceRight.get(a);/float spaceRight = spaceRightVal;/;907,909{s/c.prefWidth.get(a)/prefWidthVal/;s/c.prefHeight.get(a)/prefHeightVal/;s/c.minWidth.get(a)/minWidthVal/;s/c.minHeight.get(a)/minHeightVal/;s/c.maxWidth.get(a)/maxWidthVal/;s/c.maxHeight.get(a)/maxHeightVal/}' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/scenes/scene2d/ui/Table.java && ./gradlew gdx:compileJava -x test -q > new_build_output.log 2>&1 && grep -E "NullAway|error: \[NullAway\]" -n new_build_output.log | tail -n 20 && grep -n "errors" new_build_output.log | tail -n 5```

